<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks fell, four rose and four were flat in 15.4-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index staying flat at 1,566.5 points.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 146 zlotys in a 22.5-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
